"P2650050801" "I have some friends who collect ancient weapons, when they found out that I worked with {HeroName} they were very impressed. They follow your exploits on the nightly news. They asked me to ask you a favor. They have seen the Circle of Thorns wield some very interesting weapons, and were wondering if you could procure one for their collection?"
